# Secrets never enter the build context. The API key is passed at run time.
# Docker anchors patterns at the context root, hence **/ for files at any depth.
**/.env
**/.env.*

**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.DS_Store

.git
.claude
